// Copy to Config/Domains.xcconfig (gitignored) and list the servers that may use native passkeys,
// separated by spaces, such as `chat.example.org other.example`. Each becomes a webcredentials
// associated domain (scripts/associated-domains.sh) and an entry of the Info.plist key
// LadlePasskeyDomains. The server must publish /.well-known/apple-app-site-association for app ID
// MP92RCAPRG.app.ladle.ios under webcredentials (aprond: --apple.app-id), and accept the origin
// https://<domain> for passkeys (aprond: --webauthn.origin).
// Leave it empty to sign in with a token, email, the server's sign-in page, or as a guest.
APRON_ASSOCIATED_DOMAINS =

// Push while Ladle is closed (docs/PUSH.md): `development` or `production` adds the aps-environment
// entitlement (scripts/associated-domains.sh) and registers for APNs. Only once the App ID has the
// Push Notifications capability and a relay runs; empty, the build has no push.
LADLE_PUSH =
